  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for a program on the responsible and equitable sourcing of minerals for energy transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Justice Network Africa (TJNA) is a Pan-African civil society network that promotes fair, transparent, and progressive tax and fiscal systems across the continent. This support will strengthen community participation in benefit-sharing and accountability processes while promoting inclusive fiscal and industrial policies that enable local distribution of revenue, responsible mineral sourcing, and climate-aligned development.</narrative>
  </description>
